---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stop Being the Bottleneck — Free Strategy Call for Law Firm Owners"
  description="What to hand off first, what AI ruins when you let it run alone, and the exact order to rebuild your firm's operations in. Book a 20-minute call and bring your numbers."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Stop Being the Bottleneck",
    "description": "A 20-minute strategy call for law firm owners who are the bottleneck in their own firm.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            Stop Being <br/><span class="text-gradient-gold">the Bottleneck.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            What to hand off first, what AI ruins the moment you let it run alone, and the exact order to rebuild your firm's operations in &mdash; from an attorney who's lived it.
          </p>

          <!-- Stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="38">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">%</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of the average lawyer's day is billable work</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="25">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">hrs</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of non-billable work leaking every week</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num">$</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="500">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">K</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">what that leak is worth at a $400 rate</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What the call covers -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Where your firm's capacity is actually leaking</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Speed to lead, follow-up cadence, and after-hours coverage, audited together.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What to automate first, and what never should be</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">The exact buckets: delete, automate, assign, attorney.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The 30/60/90 order to rebuild in</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Measure, install, tighten &mdash; the same sequence behind an 82% to 97% answer rate.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; 20 minutes
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Built inside a working law firm
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 20 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/bottleneck-lead-magnet?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — the story + the four leaks
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">The Reality</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            I knew I was the bottleneck when my team stopped asking me questions.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            They weren't more independent. They were waiting. Waiting on an approval sitting in an inbox. Waiting for a callback. Waiting for a decision carried around for four days because there was never a clear hour to make it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            At 5,000 clients, here's a partial list of what was still landing on one person personally: approving demand packages, answering intake questions staff could have handled with a checklist, calling leads back at 9 PM because nobody had reached them at 2 PM, reading medical records at midnight because that was the only quiet time left.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            That's not a work ethic. That's a design flaw.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: the four leaks -->
        <div class="reveal space-y-4" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-1">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Leak 1 &middot; Intake Failure</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Calls go to voicemail. Leads sit overnight. The caller signs with the firm down the street while you're still in a deposition.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-2">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Leak 2 &middot; Follow-Up Gaps</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">One call, then silence. Signing a case takes 10 to 15 touches. Most firms make 1 to 3.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-3">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Leak 3 &middot; Admin Chaos</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Attorneys doing $20 work at $400 rates, every single day, without noticing it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card" style="animation: lpSlideIn 0.5s ease 0.55s both;">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143 1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 3.75l3 3m0 0l-3 3m3-3h-7.5" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Leak 4 &middot; Scaling Bottleneck</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">More marketing spend pouring into the same capacity to absorb it. Leads get more expensive and conversion stays flat.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;18 seconds later, that caller signed with the firm down the street.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE MATH ON YOUR DAY
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">The Math On Your Day</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          You're already paying for this. You just aren't invoicing it.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          The Clio 2025 Legal Trends Report puts the average lawyer at 38% utilization &mdash; three billable hours out of an eight-hour day. The other five go to intake calls, records requests, chasing signatures, sorting mail, and answering questions a trained person could answer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 reveal mb-10">
        <div class="lp-stat-box">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num">3.0</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Billable hours in an 8-hour day</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num">5.0</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Non-billable hours that same day</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num">25</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Non-billable hours a week</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">1,250</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Non-billable hours a year at 50 weeks</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-10 reveal">Source: Clio 2025 Legal Trends Report, 38% average utilization.</p>

      <div class="lp-rule-box max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-6">
        <div class="sm:flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="lp-rule-box-label">Run Your Number</span>
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading text-brand-navy">1,250 hrs &times; $400 <br/>= $500,000</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          1,250 hours a year, valued at whatever your time is actually worth, is the size of the problem. That figure is arithmetic, not a promise &mdash; it's there to size the leak, not forecast a return.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 mt-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        The question isn't whether you can afford help. It's whether you can afford to keep doing the five hours yourself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE SYSTEM — human in the loop
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">The Rule That Makes It Work</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5">
          Human in the loop. <span class="text-gradient-gold">Never autopilot.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every system we build runs on three layers. The layers never trade jobs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 reveal mb-10">
        <div class="lp-fix-card-v2 lp-fix-card-v2--blue">
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon lp-fix-card-v2-icon--blue">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.348 14.652a3.75 3.75 0 010-5.304m5.304 0a3.75 3.75 0 010 5.304m-7.425 2.121a6.75 6.75 0 010-9.546m9.546 0a6.75 6.75 0 010 9.546M5.106 18.894c-3.808-3.807-3.808-9.98 0-13.788m13.788 0c3.808 3.807 3.808 9.981 0 13.788M12 12h.008v.008H12V12z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest mt-4">Layer 1</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Machine</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Speed and availability. Answers in seconds at any hour, never forgets a follow-up, never loses a document, never gets discouraged on touch number nine. <strong class="text-white">It decides nothing.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-fix-card-v2">
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.982 18.725A7.488 7.488 0 0012 15.75a7.488 7.488 0 00-5.982 2.975m11.963 0a9 9 0 10-11.963 0m11.963 0A8.966 8.966 0 0112 21a8.966 8.966 0 01-5.982-2.275M15 9.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-widest mt-4">Layer 2</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Trained Person</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Judgment and relationship. Qualifies the case, handles the story that comes out sideways, hears the hesitation in a caller's voice, knows when to escalate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-fix-card-v2 lp-fix-card-v2--purple">
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon lp-fix-card-v2-icon--purple">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 006 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 016 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 016-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0018 18a8.967 8.967 0 00-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25" /></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-300 uppercase tracking-widest mt-4">Layer 3</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Attorney</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Law and strategy. The negotiation and client conversations that change what a case is worth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-10">
        <div class="lp-rule-box">
          <span class="lp-rule-box-label">Hard Rule 1</span>
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">The machine never makes a decision that changes the value of a case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-rule-box">
          <span class="lp-rule-box-label">Hard Rule 2</span>
